@*
=========================================================
FILE: CountryFlag.razor

PURPOSE:
A country's flag as a small picture, next to its name.

RESPONSIBILITIES:
- Show the flag of a two-letter country code from the bundled set (wwwroot/flags, flag-icons, MIT)

IMPORTANT NOTES:
- Owner, 2026-10-25: Windows shows flag emoji as two letters ("HT"), so pages use pictures; a list option
  (select) cannot hold a picture and keeps the emoji
- Decorative: the country name is always written beside it (alt is empty)
=========================================================
*@

@if (Code is { Length: 2 } code && char.IsAsciiLetter(code[0]) && char.IsAsciiLetter(code[1]))
{
    <img class="vx-flag" src="/flags/@(code.ToLowerInvariant()).svg" width="20" height="15" alt="" loading="lazy" />
}

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string? Code { get; set; }
}
